        {
          "segment_id": "note:005",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "Here, he means he has no expectations for himself. \"Mei xi wang\" can also mean \"no chance.\" For example: \"Ni you xi wang shang da xue de ma?\" (Do you have any chance of getting into college?) \"Mei xi wang.\" (No. There's no way I'll get in.)",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-07-15-family-expectations_note_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
